  "description": "The extraction surfaced dozens of provisions that contradict each other or depend on machinery that does not yet exist: penalties stated unqualified in one place and capped in another, asymmetric stan",
  "orientation": "The extraction surfaced dozens of provisions that contradict each other or depend on machinery that does not yet exist: penalties stated unqualified in one place and capped in another, asymmetric standards of proof for finding versus disproving misalignment, aggregate caps that nothing enforces, prose limits beside enforced limits that disagree, and reference code that contradicts its own normative text. Several are clerical; several are structural. They are collected here because a contradiction is the most actionable thing a knowledge base can hold.",
